        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>Explanation</name>
          <id>211</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Enables exporting a chart of accounts to a file in one of the following formats:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) and Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>امکان خروج سرفصل حساب‌ها به فایلی در یکی از قالب‌های زیر را فراهم می‌کند:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) و Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• سند صفحه‌گسترده (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Consente di caricare il piano di conti nel file in uno dei seguenti formati:
• Cartelle di lavoro Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) e Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Tabelle elettroniche Open Document (.ods)
• Documento tabulare (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Pozwala przesłać plan kont do pliku w jednym z formatów:
• Arkusze Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) i Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Tabele elektroniczne Open Document (.ods)
• Dokument tabelaryczny (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Позволяет выгрузить план счетов в файл в одном из форматов:
• Книги Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) и Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Электронные таблицы Open Document (.ods)
• Табличный документ (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Aşağıdaki biçimlerden birinde dosyaya hesap planını dışa aktarmanızı sağlar:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) ve Excel 2007 (.xlsx) çalışma kitapları
• Open Document elektronik tabloları (.ods)
• E-tablo belgesi (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Cho phép kết xuất hệ thống tài khoản vào tệp theo một trong số định dạng:
• Sổ Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) và Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Bảng điện tử Open Document (.ods)
• Văn bản dạng bảng (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>ExplanationExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>213</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>ExplanationContextMenu</name>
            <id>212</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>Label</type>
          <width>45</width>
          <height>4</height>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
